  "text": "### Interest Rate Tiers  \n| Balance Tier | Annual Interest Rate (AER) | Annual Interest Rate (Gross) |\n|---|---|---|\n| £0–£10,000 | 4.50% | 4.50% |\n| £10,001–£50,000 | 4.70% | 4.70% |\n| £50,001+ | 4.80% | 4.80% |  \n**Interest Accrual:** Monthly (calculated daily, paid on last business day of month)  \n**Example:** £10,000 balance in Tier 1\n- Monthly interest: £37.50 (= £10,000 × 4.50% ÷ 12)\n- Annual interest: £450.00",
